			"notes": "Highlights:\n- World generation fixes, no more off thread world access\n- Cleanup forge chunkloading tickets\n- Fixed a camera null pointer crash while changing dimensions.\n- Fixed glass being opaque\n- Improved texture lookup to handle more mods\n- Added GTNHLib above hotbar messages for DH status text on 1.7.10, with chat as a fallback.\n- Fixed transparent block rendering under overhangs and in full sunlight, and corrected snow layer handling on Minecraft 1.12.2 and older.\n- Reworked server tick budgeting\n- Fixed crash with EndlessIDs\n\n## What's Changed\n* Update DH to latest by @DarkShadow44 in https://github.com/DarkShadow44/DistantHorizonsStandalone/pull/109\n* Update by @DarkShadow44 in https://github.com/DarkShadow44/DistantHorizonsStandalone/pull/118\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DarkShadow44/DistantHorizonsStandalone/compare/upstream-preview7...upstream-preview8"
		},
